  "description": "Show paginated SSRS / Power BI reports run by DocWright.Reporting in a browser: an HTML + inline-SVG projection with a JSON region map, plus hit-testing, action resolution, full-text search, drill-down toggles with incremental re-pagination, and a design-time preview from sample data. Output is deterministic, escaped and script-free, and is driven by the same page model that produces the PDF, so a preview and an export cannot disagree.",
